PART 34 — If they ask ElGamal

Don't panic.

Find your ElGamal block.

Question will generally give:

p
g
x
m / authorization code

Use the exact parameters.

For standard ElGamal:

y = g^x mod p

c1 = g^k mod p

shared = y^k mod p

c2 = m × shared mod p

Then decryption:

shared = c1^x mod p

m = c2 × shared^-1 mod p

Your template already has this.

Do not invent new parameters if the question gives them.

